quran[27]{c,v,t}:
  83,35,"(reclining) upon couches, they will observe:"
  83,36,Have the disbelievers been paid back for what they used to do?
  84,1,"When the sky bursts open,"
  84,2,"and obeys (the command of) its Lord, as it rightly should,"
  84,3,"and when the earth is stretched out,"
  84,4,"and throws out all that is in it and becomes empty,"
  84,5,"and obeys (the command of) its Lord, as it rightly should."
  84,6,O humankind! You are labouring towards your Lord restlessly and shall (eventually) meet Him.
  84,7,"Whoever is given his record in his right hand,"
  84,8,"he shall be reckoned with an easy reckoning,"
  84,9,and he will return to his family joyfully.
  84,10,"And whoever is given his record (in his left hand) from behind his back,"
  84,11,"he will pray for (instant) annihilation,"
  84,12,and he will enter into a burning Fire.
  84,13,"Indeed, he used to be joyful among his people."
  84,14,"Indeed, he thought he would never return (to Allah for the Reckoning)."
  84,15,"Yes! Indeed, his Lord was All-Seeing of him."
  84,16,"So I swear by the twilight,"
  84,17,"by the night and what it covers,"
  84,18,"and by the moon, when it grows full:"
  84,19,You will indeed ride from stage to stage.
  84,20,So what is (the matter) with them that they do not believe?
  84,21,"When the Qur’an is recited to them, they do not prostrate (in submission)."
  84,22,"Instead, the disbelievers persist in denial."
  84,23,But Allah knows best what they hide.
  84,24,So warn them of a painful punishment.
  84,25,"But as for those who believe and perform righteous deeds, they will have a never-ending reward."
